<title>USA: Lason closes Corporate Copies acquisition.</title>
<headline>Lason closes Corporate Copies acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>TROY, Mich. 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lason Inc said Wednesday it completed the acquisition of Corporate Copies Inc, which provides document management and imaging services to legal and commercial businesses in  Richmond, Va. and Washington, D.C. area, for an undisclosed amount of cash.</p>
<p>Corporate Copies has annual revenues of about $3 million.</p>
<p>Lason provides integrated outsourcing services for records management, document management and business communications.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
